This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-python3-webcomponents layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: git://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core.git
  branch: scarthgap

  URI: git://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded.git
  branch: scarthgap

 From meta-openembedded, you need the following layers:
  meta-oe
  meta-python


Patches
=======

Please submit any patches against the meta-python3-webcomponents layer to a github PR or issue
and cc: the maintainer:

Maintainer: Toby Flynn  <tflynn@redwiretechnology.com>

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-python3-webcomponents layer to your build
 II. Misc


I. Adding the meta-python3-webcomponents layer to your build
=================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-python3-webcomponents'

II. Misc
========

--- This layer builds on meta-python to add packages for fastapi and other python packages useful for embedded web servers ---
